  "description": "If you had enough power to make any wish come true, but only using one word, what would you say? This story is about a God called Lilith who has the power to create anything she desires by speaking a single word. Sadly, no one ever taught her how to use her power. She and her brother travel the world together, hoping to find answers. Their quest follows a very specific rule - they spend three months in a place. When the time is up, they have to move on. When they stumble upon a strange group of people in a forest, the divine siblings uncover a mystery that may require more than their allocated three months in that area to untangle.",
